package admin

const connectionTemplate = `<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>MCP Gateway · Connection</title><style>` + adminCSS + `</style><script src="{{.BasePath}}/admin/connection.js" defer></script></head><body><main class="connection-page" data-connection data-base="{{.BasePath}}">
<header class="page-header"><div><h1>Connection</h1><p>Connect your clients to MCP Gateway.</p><p class="identity">{{if .Authentik}}Signed in as {{.User}} via Authentik.{{else}}Signed in with administrator token.{{end}}</p></div><form method="post" action="{{.BasePath}}/admin/logout"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="{{.CSRF}}"><button class="secondary">Sign out</button></form></header>
<nav class="admin-nav" aria-label="Administration"><a href="{{.BasePath}}/admin/servers">Servers</a><a href="{{.BasePath}}/admin/connection" aria-current="page">Connection</a></nav>
<section><h2>MCP endpoint</h2>{{if .Endpoint}}<div class="copy-row"><input id="mcp-endpoint" readonly value="{{.Endpoint}}" aria-label="MCP endpoint"><button type="button" class="secondary" data-copy="mcp-endpoint">Copy address</button></div>{{else}}<p>Connection address is not configured. Set GATEWAY_MCP_EXTERNAL_URL to the external MCP endpoint.</p>{{end}}
<p>Transport: <strong>Streamable HTTP</strong>. Use the same key with either authentication header:</p><pre>Authorization: Bearer &lt;key&gt;
or
X-API-Key: &lt;key&gt;</pre><p>Choose one header per request. Sending both or repeating a header is rejected. Codex uses Bearer by default. Use a separate key for each client.</p><p>Every key can use the enabled servers and tools, including tools that make changes. Administrator sign-in is separate.</p>
{{if .Endpoint}}<details><summary>Connect Codex</summary><pre id="codex-command">{{.Command}}</pre><button type="button" class="secondary" data-copy="codex-command">Copy command</button><p>Set MCP_GATEWAY_TOKEN in the environment of the Codex process to the key you created. The command reads this variable; it does not contain the key. For the desktop app, the variable must be available to the app process; setting it only in a different terminal does not configure the running app. Reload the MCP connection after configuring it.</p></details>{{end}}
{{if .Endpoint}}<details><summary>Connect Claude Code</summary><p>Create a separate key named Claude Code. Set MCP_GATEWAY_TOKEN in the environment of the terminal that starts Claude Code. Merge one configuration below into your project's .mcp.json, preserving existing servers. The variable reference stays in the file; the key does not.</p><h3>Bearer</h3><pre id="claude-bearer">{{.ClaudeBearer}}</pre><button type="button" class="secondary" data-copy="claude-bearer">Copy Bearer configuration</button><details><summary>Use X-API-Key instead</summary><pre id="claude-api-key">{{.ClaudeAPIKey}}</pre><button type="button" class="secondary" data-copy="claude-api-key">Copy X-API-Key configuration</button></details><p>Choose one configuration. Start Claude Code in that project, approve the MCP configuration when prompted, then use /mcp to check the connection. After changing the environment or configuration, start a new session. These instructions are for Claude Code.</p></details>{{end}}
<details><summary>How to use the gateway</summary><p>The gateway exposes discover_server, discover_tools, get_tool_schema and invoke_tool. Discover a server, list its tools, read the selected input schema, then invoke the tool with matching arguments. Server and tool switches control availability for all clients. A removed key is rejected on subsequent requests; operations already accepted may finish.</p></details></section>
<section><h2>Client keys</h2><p>Create a separate key for each application so you can revoke its access independently. New keys can be shown or copied again after signing in.</p>
<form data-key-create method="post" action="{{.BasePath}}/admin/connection/keys/create"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="{{.CSRF}}"><input type="hidden" name="revision" value="{{.Revision}}"><label>Key name<input name="name" required maxlength="128" placeholder="Laptop or Personal Assistant" autocomplete="off"></label><button>Create key</button></form>
<div class="key-card one-time" data-issued {{if not .Token}}hidden{{end}}><h3>Client key</h3><p>The value is hidden after 60 seconds or when you leave this page.</p><div class="copy-row"><input id="issued-key" readonly value="{{.Token}}" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" aria-label="Client key"><button type="button" class="secondary" data-copy="issued-key">Copy key</button></div><button type="button" class="secondary" data-dismiss>Hide key</button><noscript><p>JavaScript is disabled; automatic hiding is unavailable. Select and copy the value manually, then open <a href="{{.BasePath}}/admin/connection">Connection</a> to close this response.</p></noscript></div>
<p data-key-status role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><button type="button" class="secondary" data-keys-refresh hidden>Refresh keys</button>
<div data-key-list>{{$root:=.}}{{range .Keys}}<article class="key-card" data-key-id="{{.ID}}"><h3>{{.Name}}</h3>{{if .Managed}}<p><code>{{.Prefix}}…</code> · Created {{.CreatedAt}}</p>{{if .Recoverable}}<form data-key-reveal method="post" action="{{$root.BasePath}}/admin/connection/keys/{{.ID}}/reveal"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="{{$root.CSRF}}"><input type="hidden" name="revision" value="{{$root.Revision}}"><div class="key-buttons"><button type="submit" class="secondary" data-reveal-id="{{.ID}}">Show key</button><button type="button" class="secondary" data-copy-key="{{.ID}}">Copy key</button></div></form>{{else}}<p>Repeat display is unavailable. Create a new key if you need to show it again.</p>{{end}}<details><summary>Delete key</summary><form data-key-delete method="post" action="{{$root.BasePath}}/admin/connection/keys/{{.ID}}/delete"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="{{$root.CSRF}}"><input type="hidden" name="revision" value="{{$root.Revision}}"><label>Type {{.Name}} to confirm deletion<input name="confirm" required autocomplete="off" maxlength="128"></label><p>Clients using this key will lose access. This cannot be undone.</p><button class="danger">Delete key</button></form></details>{{else}}<p>Managed by environment. Preserved for existing clients; the value is not displayed here.</p>{{end}}</article>{{end}}</div></section>
<p class="muted">Registry revision <span data-key-revision>{{.Revision}}</span>.</p><noscript><p>Copy buttons require JavaScript; select the text manually. Forms still work.</p></noscript></main></body></html>`
